error[R0609] (conservative): `for` from 1 up to 8 with a negative step never runs
--> 13:16: negative step, but the start is below the end
  = note: a negative step needs the start above the end — did you mean `8, 1, -1`, or a positive step?
  = note: valid Luau — the body is provably dead

error[R0609] (conservative): `for` with a step of 0 never advances
--> 22:21: step of 0
  = note: Luau skips the body when the start is below the end and repeats it forever otherwise — neither is a loop
  = note: valid Luau — never useful
